# JSON Schema for Spell Definition

Defines the mandatory data contract between the LLM and the Spellwright engine for spell generation.

## Purpose

Ensure all spell JSONs follow a single, validatable contract to enable automatic validation and consistent baking.

## Scope

**Applies To:**

- JSON input/output between LLM and engine
- Generator, modifiers, and payloads fields
- Validation rules and constraints

## Required Fields

**Top-Level:**

- `spellName` (string) - Unique spell identifier
- `generator` (object) - Spell delivery method
- `payloads` (array) - At least one effect

**Optional:**

- `modifiers` (array) - Behavior modifications

## Generator Schema

**Required:**

- `type` (enum) - Generator type

**Type: `projectile`**

- `speed` (number) - Movement speed (0.1-1000)
- `lifetime` (number) - Duration in seconds (0.1-60)

**Type: `cone`**

- `radius` (number) - Cone reach (0.1-100)
- `angle` (number) - Cone angle in degrees (1-180)
- `lifetime` (number) - Duration in seconds (0.1-60)

**Type: `area_of_effect`**

- `radius` (number) - AoE radius (0.1-100)
- `lifetime` (number) - Duration in seconds (0.1-60)

**Type: `self_cast`**

- `duration` (number) - Effect duration (0.1-60)

## Modifier Schema

**Optional Array of Objects:**

**Type: `homing`**

- `turn_speed` (number) - Rotation speed (0.1-1000)
- `max_range` (number) - Detection range (1-100)

**Type: `chain`**

- `max_bounces` (number) - Chain count (1-20)
- `chain_radius` (number) - Search radius (1-50)

**Type: `pierce`**

- `pierce_count` (number) - Pierce count (1-20)

**Type: `fork`**

- `fork_count` (number) - Split count (2-10)
- `fork_angle` (number) - Spread angle (1-180)

**Type: `multi_shot`**

- `projectile_count` (number) - Projectile count (2-20)
- `spread_angle` (number) - Spread angle (1-180)

## Payload Schema

**Required Array (Minimum 1):**

**Type: `damage`**

- `amount` (number) - Damage value (1-10000)
- `elemental_type` (enum) - Damage type

**Type: `heal`**

- `amount` (number) - Heal value (1-10000)

**Type: `apply_status_effect`**

- `effect_name` (enum) - Status effect type
- `duration` (number) - Effect duration (0.1-60)
- `intensity` (number) - Effect strength (1-100)

**Type: `spawn_entity`**

- `entity_prefab` (string) - Prefab identifier
- `spawn_count` (number) - Entity count (1-100)

## Enumerations

**Generator Types:**

- `projectile`, `cone`, `area_of_effect`, `self_cast`

**Modifier Types:**

- `homing`, `chain`, `pierce`, `fork`, `multi_shot`

**Payload Types:**

- `damage`, `heal`, `apply_status_effect`, `spawn_entity`

**Elemental Types:**

- `fire`, `frost`, `shock`, `physical`, `holy`, `arcane`, `poison`

**Effect Names:**

- `slow`, `burn`, `stun`, `poison`, `bleed`, `freeze`, `silence`

## Validation Rules

**DO:**

- Validate against schema before processing
- Enforce required fields per type
- Check numeric ranges
- Verify enum values
- Ensure at least one payload
- Validate modifier compatibility
- Reject invalid combinations

**DON'T:**

- Accept empty payloads array
- Allow invalid combinations (homing + cone/aoe)
- Allow pierce + chain together
- Accept types outside enums
- Accept numbers outside ranges
- Skip validation

## Numeric Ranges

| Field                  | Minimum | Maximum | Recommended |
| ---------------------- | ------- | ------- | ----------- |
| `speed`                | 0.1     | 1000    | 5-30        |
| `lifetime`             | 0.1     | 60      | 1-10        |
| `radius`               | 0.1     | 100     | 1-20        |
| `angle`                | 1       | 180     | 30-90       |
| `turn_speed`           | 0.1     | 1000    | 50-200      |
| `max_bounces`          | 1       | 20      | 2-5         |
| `pierce_count`         | 1       | 20      | 2-5         |
| `fork_count`           | 2       | 10      | 2-4         |
| `projectile_count`     | 2       | 20      | 3-7         |
| `amount` (damage/heal) | 1       | 10000   | 10-100      |
| `duration`             | 0.1     | 60      | 1-10        |
| `intensity`            | 1       | 100     | 10-50       |

## Compatibility Matrix

| Modifier   | Compatible Generators            | Incompatible Modifiers |
| ---------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------- |
| homing     | projectile                       | -                      |
| chain      | projectile, cone, area_of_effect | pierce                 |
| pierce     | projectile                       | chain                  |
| fork       | projectile                       | -                      |
| multi_shot | all                              | -                      |

## Validation Checklist

Before accepting JSON:

- [ ] Required fields present: `spellName`, `generator`, `payloads`
- [ ] `generator.type` is valid enum value
- [ ] Generator required fields present per type
- [ ] `modifiers` array has valid types and fields
- [ ] `payloads` array has at least one entry
- [ ] Payload types are valid enum values
- [ ] Payload required fields present per type
- [ ] Invalid combinations rejected (homing+cone/aoe, pierce+chain)
- [ ] Numeric values within ranges
- [ ] Enum values are valid

## Three-Layer Validation

**Layer 1: LLM API (Function Calling)**

- Schema enforcement at API level
- Type validation
- Required field validation

**Layer 2: LLM Prompt (Few-Shot)**

- Example-based guidance
- Pattern reinforcement
- Edge case handling

**Layer 3: Client-Side (Schema + Rules)**

- Complete schema validation
- Range checking
- Compatibility validation
- Business rule enforcement

## Integration

This standard works with:

- **LLM Integration** (`concept/llm-integration.mdc`)
